0..71 Comment "// An omitted model implicit at a manifest model type resolved (#2317):"
72..148 Comment "// `@[s : Model(Dial) with sort C = Integer]` binds no parameter for `C`, so"
149..220 Comment "// no argument forces it, and the sort the type fixes is what tells the"
221..299 Comment "// modules in scope apart. `Up` counts integers and `Flips` flags; only `Up`\'s"
300..375 Comment "// carrier is the one the slot fixes, so a call leaving the slot out passes"
376..384 Comment "// `Up`."
